<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa JSE appoints Lowenthal deputy chairman.</title>
<headline>S.Africa JSE appoints Lowenthal deputy chairman.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Friday it had appointed Norman Lowenthal as its deputy chairman.</p>
<p>Lowenthal, who will replace Chris Niehaus who resigned due to business commitments, would serve in this capacity for the remainder of the committee's term of office, the JSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>Niehaus would continue as a member of the committee until the next committee election scheduled for mid-April.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
